_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p077","quote":"陽生"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m032-0024","chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-037-wei:p032","quote":"悼公"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與事件暫定人物；不以同稱、官號或短名全域合併，未見本名不補造。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p074","quote":"晏孺子元年春，田乞偽事高、國者，每朝，乞驂乘，言曰：「子得君，大夫皆自危，欲謀作亂。」又謂諸大夫曰：「高昭子可畏，及未發，先之。」大夫從之。六月，田乞、鮑牧乃與大夫以兵入公宮，攻高昭子。昭子聞之，與國惠子救公。公師敗，田乞之徒追之，國惠子奔莒，遂反殺高昭子。晏圉奔魯。八月，齊秉意茲。田乞敗二相，乃使人之魯召公子陽生。陽生至齊，私匿田乞家。十月戊子，田乞請諸大夫曰：「常之母有魚菽之祭，幸來會飲。」會飲，田乞盛陽生橐中，置坐中央，發橐出陽生，曰：「此乃齊君矣！」大夫皆伏謁。將與大夫盟而立之，鮑牧醉，乞誣大夫曰：「吾與鮑牧謀共立陽生。」鮑牧怒曰：「子忘景公之命乎？」諸大夫相視欲悔，陽生前，頓首曰：「可則立之，否則已。」鮑牧恐禍起，乃復曰：「皆景公子也，何為不可！」乃與盟，立陽生，是為悼公。悼公入宮，使人遷晏孺子於駘，殺之幕下，而逐孺子母芮子。芮子故賤而孺子少，故無權，國人輕之。","source_term":"皆景公子"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji032-061","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"wuz_yxe_b9k"}},{"id":"yht_8tu_hv4_B","label":"陽生（田世家齊悼公候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"齊悼公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0003"]},{"surface":"陽生","mention_ids":["c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0069","c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0072","c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0086","c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0008","c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0011","c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0052","c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0066","c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0103","c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0130","c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0175"]},{"surface":"悼公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0185","c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0204","c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0010"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0003","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p012","quote":"齊悼公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0069","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p009","quote":"陽生"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0072","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p009","quote":"陽生"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m009-0086","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p009","quote":"陽生"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p010","quote":"陽生"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0011","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p010","quote":"陽生"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p010","quote":"陽生"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0066","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p010","quote":"陽生"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0103","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p010","quote":"陽生"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0130","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p010","quote":"陽生"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0175","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p010","quote":"陽生"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0185","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p010","quote":"悼公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0204","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p010","quote":"悼公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m012-0010","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p012","quote":"悼公"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p009","quote":"景公太子死，後有寵姬曰芮子，生子荼。景公病，命其相國惠子與髙昭子以子荼爲太子。景公卒，兩相髙、國立荼，是爲晏孺子。而田乞不説，欲立景公他子陽生。陽生素與乞歡。晏孺子之立也，陽生奔魯。田乞偽事髙昭子、國惠子者，毎朝代參乘，言曰：「始諸大夫不欲立孺子。孺子旣立，君相之，大夫皆自危，謀作亂。」又紿大夫曰：「髙昭子可畏也，及未發先之。」諸大夫從之。田乞、鮑牧與大夫以兵入公室，攻髙昭子。昭子聞之，與國惠子救公。公師敗。田乞之衆追國惠子，惠子奔莒，遂返殺髙昭子。晏（孺子）［圉］奔魯。","source_term":"景公他子陽生"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji046-017","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"yht_8tu_hv4"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-066-wu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-066","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0018"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu:p020"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0018","mention_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0018"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-066-wu"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"unresolved_identity_cases":[{"id":"ic-shiji066-dao-yang","status":"unresolved","candidate_person_ids":["9uw_tzo_yj8","vle_lyb_962","wuz_yxe_b9k_A","yht_8tu_hv4_B"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu:p020","c-shiji-032-qi:p074","c-shiji-046-tian:p010"],"note":"本篇記齊鮑氏殺其君悼公而立陽生，將悼公與陽生作先後二人；齊太公世家記立陽生是為悼公，田敬仲完世家同記陽生是為悼公。此為來源用號及事件先後衝突，不能由同名或用號直接合本篇二人；保留各篇人物ID與原文，待底本校勘或具體研究參考。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","source_id":"s-shiji-066-wu"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-shiji066-012","person_id":"9uw_tzo_yj8","event_type":"death","status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"source_term":"齊鮑氏殺其君悼公","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","source_id":"s-shiji-066-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p020","quote":"吳王既誅伍子胥，遂伐齊。齊鮑氏殺其君悼公而立陽生。吳王欲討其賊，不勝而去。其後二年，吳王召魯衛之君會之橐皋。其明年，因北大會諸侯於黃池，以令周室。越王句踐襲殺吳太子，破吳兵。吳王聞之，乃歸，使使厚幣與越平。後九年，越王句踐遂滅吳，殺王夫差；而誅太宰嚭，以不忠於其君，而外受重賂，與己比周也。","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0018"}],"interpretation_note":"本篇悼公被殺按原文保存；悼公與陽生跨篇身份及來源矛盾另待核，不校改原字或直接合人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"9uw_tzo_yj8","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji066-041","person_id":"9uw_tzo_yj8","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-066-wu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["悼公"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p020","quote":"吳王既誅伍子胥，遂伐齊。齊鮑氏殺其君悼公而立陽生。吳王欲討其賊，不勝而去。其後二年，吳王召魯衛之君會之橐皋。其明年，因北大會諸侯於黃池，以令周室。越王句踐襲殺吳太子，破吳兵。吳王聞之，乃歸，使使厚幣與越平。後九年，越王句踐遂滅吳，殺王夫差；而誅太宰嚭，以不忠於其君，而外受重賂，與己比周也。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示姓名及局部敘事暫接異稱：公子光自立為闔廬、軫立為昭王、勝號白公；王稱隨敘事主體分段。王子綦佯充王不接昭王，與後文司馬子綦暫分候選但不斷言異人。悼公與陽生按本文分存，矛盾待版本覆核；鮑氏不強接鮑牧。未名父子只按本段明示保存，不補姓名。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p074","text":"晏孺子元年春，田乞偽事高、國者，每朝，乞驂乘，言曰：「子得君，大夫皆自危，欲謀作亂。」又謂諸大夫曰：「高昭子可畏，及未發，先之。」大夫從之。六月，田乞、鮑牧乃與大夫以兵入公宮，攻高昭子。昭子聞之，與國惠子救公。公師敗，田乞之徒追之，國惠子奔莒，遂反殺高昭子。晏圉奔魯。八月，齊秉意茲。田乞敗二相，乃使人之魯召公子陽生。陽生至齊，私匿田乞家。十月戊子，田乞請諸大夫曰：「常之母有魚菽之祭，幸來會飲。」會飲，田乞盛陽生橐中，置坐中央，發橐出陽生，曰：「此乃齊君矣！」大夫皆伏謁。將與大夫盟而立之，鮑牧醉，乞誣大夫曰：「吾與鮑牧謀共立陽生。」鮑牧怒曰：「子忘景公之命乎？」諸大夫相視欲悔，陽生前，頓首曰：「可則立之，否則已。」鮑牧恐禍起，乃復曰：「皆景公子也，何為不可！」乃與盟，立陽生，是為悼公。悼公入宮，使人遷晏孺子於駘，殺之幕下，而逐孺子母芮子。芮子故賤而孺子少，故無權，國人輕之。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"晏孺子","kind":"person","person_id":"wuz_yxe_b9k_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"田乞","kind":"person","person_id":"gf2_bab_2ln","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"高、國","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、族稱或未定指代；齊秉意茲等疑讀待版本校勘，不補熟知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"乞","kind":"person","person_id":"gf2_bab_2ln","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0051","start":51,"end":54,"surface":"高昭子","kind":"person","person_id":"8an_gej_gnk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"田乞","kind":"person","person_id":"gf2_bab_2ln","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"鮑牧","kind":"person","person_id":"2bq_vfh_tem","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0089","start":89,"end":92,"surface":"高昭子","kind":"person","person_id":"8an_gej_gnk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"昭子","kind":"person","person_id":"8an_gej_gnk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0099","start":99,"end":102,"surface":"國惠子","kind":"person","person_id":"t8b_b8w_pcn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"田乞","kind":"person","person_id":"gf2_bab_2ln","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0116","start":116,"end":119,"surface":"國惠子","kind":"person","person_id":"t8b_b8w_pcn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m074-0125","start":125,"end":128,"surface":"高昭子","kind":"person","person_id":"