_hv4_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"yht_8tu_hv4_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m010-0209","start":209,"end":211,"surface":"田乞","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p020","text":"吳王既誅伍子胥，遂伐齊。齊鮑氏殺其君悼公而立陽生。吳王欲討其賊，不勝而去。其後二年，吳王召魯衛之君會之橐皋。其明年，因北大會諸侯於黃池，以令周室。越王句踐襲殺吳太子，破吳兵。吳王聞之，乃歸，使使厚幣與越平。後九年，越王句踐遂滅吳，殺王夫差；而誅太宰嚭，以不忠於其君，而外受重賂，與己比周也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh_AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"伍子胥","kind":"person","person_id":"g9h_5ih_ug1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"齊鮑氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不直接等同鮑牧。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"9uw_tzo_yj8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"陽生","kind":"person","person_id":"vle_lyb_962","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh_AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"5dm_e40_rqh_AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m020-0045","start":45,"end":49,"surface":"魯衛之君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或未定指代，未補姓名及成員；鮑氏不